        {
          "id": "360ae579-dda2-445a-afb9-c76f56131126",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "放学路上被暴雨拦住。我们挤进一家只有四张桌子的咖啡厅，两杯热可可，谁也没提走的事。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b8341852-d1d0-4b9c-a5e7-5b1ceb3ff564",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-hoshino",
            "characterName": "星野",
            "expression": "平静",
            "position": "right",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「我妈以前说，流星其实是没说完的话。天上挂不住，就掉下来了。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "e0fa1b63-307b-4118-8a8b-5b70fc0a0818",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-hoshino",
            "characterName": "星野",
            "expression": "害羞",
            "position": "right",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「所以啊——想说的话，要趁看得见星星的时候说完哦。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "43729672-a2a5-4059-8e4d-2bcb1d13d863",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-me",
            "characterName": "我",
            "expression": "",
            "position": "",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": false,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「那你有什么想说的？」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "be0bd1e6-7975-478e-bcdc-aa22b55b1433",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-hoshino",
            "characterName": "星野",
            "expression": "开心",
            "position": "right",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「秘密～等流星雨那天，一口气说给你。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "15283b7e-8346-45e5-9037-d3999ac3160e",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "玻璃上的雨把街灯拉成一条条光的毛线。她用指尖在雾气上画了一个五角星，又一个。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "cc22a8db-9b50-4d36-91ae-c91b3ea3ffa0",
          "type": "scene",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "sceneId": "scene-ground",
            "sceneName": "操场",
            "uri": "",
            "autoAddToGallery": "true",
            "galleryMethodTarget": "avg.internal.default-shell/add-to-gallery",
