        {
          "id": "513be599-2870-4138-96b3-d270a114a174",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "第二十六天。难得的云隙，操场边一阵妖风，把她的观测日志吹散了页。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "13b42fdf-84fd-4d5e-8dfc-3c3e49db5388",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "我追着纸页跑，替她按住最后一张——一张折了三折的表格。「转学确认书」。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5a68d7fa-dd58-488c-928a-1db543765875",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "北海道，札幌市。监护人签名栏，空着。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b9651f9f-174f-4d8c-bf38-518cfd15a0f6",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-me",
            "characterName": "我",
            "expression": "",
            "position": "",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": false,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「……」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "33e4b0f1-3bcd-4623-bb46-564ea27c6771",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "我把纸压回她的日志里，装作什么都没看见。她接过去的时候，手指在封面上停了一下。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4e325863-68f2-4839-9362-66369984bd92",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "谁也没有提这件事。风把这件事按回了纸页里。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "f56d37fb-eef1-47af-a275-c68c47d38d4b",
          "type": "scene",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "sceneId": "scene-park",
            "sceneName": "公园",
            "uri": "",
            "autoAddToGallery": "true",
            "galleryMethodTarget": "avg.internal.default-shell/add-to-gallery",
            "transitionMode": "fade",
            "transitionDuration": "1000",
