        {
          "id": "21e6b1ec-3556-458f-9d36-cc5d716689a9",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "第二十九天，云裂开一道缝。她拉着我，在第一颗星亮起来之前冲到了公园。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "183b4470-c336-4769-9228-e5c0b7cdb250",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-hoshino",
            "characterName": "星野",
            "expression": "平静",
            "position": "right",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「看。那颗星的光，是很多年以前发出的。也许它早就熄灭了——我们看到的，只是它出发时的样子。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "ffc40b6f-3105-44de-bc0e-090aa49fba18",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-hoshino",
            "characterName": "星野",
            "expression": "害羞",
            "position": "right",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「所以我才喜欢星星。它们特别守时。就算迟到，也是从很多年前就出发的那种守时。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "bf0f25f3-6073-4cfc-b622-6e03d4ff103f",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "那天她说的每一句话，后来我都在脑海里抄写了很多遍。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "cd47c460-9efd-4dc5-b4ac-61f91f572106",
          "type": "scene",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "sceneId": "scene-hallway",
            "sceneName": "走廊",
            "uri": "",
            "autoAddToGallery": "true",
            "galleryMethodTarget": "avg.internal.default-shell/add-to-gallery",
            "transitionMode": "fade",
            "transitionDuration": "1000",
            "transitionDirection": "",
            "transitionStrips": "12",
            "transitionRuleUri": "",
            "transitionCenterX": "50",
            "transitionCenterY": "50",
            "transitionSoftness": "",
            "transitionZoomScale": "1.14",
            "transitionBlurStrength": "16",
            "transitionMosaicSize": "52",
            "transitionGlitchStrength": "100",
            "transitionGlitchColorShift": "4.5",
            "transitionGlitchScanlines": "17",
            "transitionPagePerspective": "50",
            "transitionPageShadow": "38",
            "waitForComplete": "false",
            "resetCamera": "false",
            "mouseParallaxEnabled": "false",
            "mouseParallaxAmplitude": "4",
            "mouseParallaxEdgeEase": "0",
